## Fonts

The SCENE3D template does not load any web fonts and does not embed text in
its frames. Narration (when added by the consumer) is the caller's
responsibility.

## Audio

The SCENE3D line currently produces silent video. Adding voice / music / SFX
later should use only assets in the parent repository's CC0 catalog
(`assets/audio/*`, see `assets/audio/bgm/README.md`).
